                "category": "interaction",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>The Abomination is permanently sickened 1 and can't reduce this. A creature that succeeds at a DC 22 Medicine or Crafting check (or a Fleshmancer's Read the Meat) identifies a failing graft; an attack targeting it (AC 20, 15 HP) drops the Abomination to stunned 1 when the graft is destroyed. A Fleshmancer knows exactly where to cut: its saves against a Graft's effects land one degree worse.</p>"
